0,Kra–Dai languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kra–Dai_languages,"May 18, 2026 - The Kra–Dai languages (/ˈkrɑːdaɪ/ KRAH-dy), also known as Tai–Kadai (/ˈtaɪkədaɪ/ TY-kə-dy) and Daic (/ˈdaɪ.ɪk/ DY-ik), are a language family in mainland Southeast Asia, southern China, and northeastern India. All languages in the family are tonal, including Thai and Lao, the ...",Tày,Kra-Dai
